 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 511446,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve this system of linear equations by substitution:\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ \\begin{gathered}\n  x - 3y =  - 3 \\hfill \\\\\n  x + y = 5 \\hfill \\\\ \n\\end{gathered}  \\right.\">\\left\\{ \\begin{gathered}\n  x - 3y =  - 3 \\hfill \\\\\n  x + y = 5 \\hfill \\\\ \n\\end{gathered}  \\right.</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{x - 3y =  - 3}\\\\\n{x + y = 5}\n\\end{array}} \\right.\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Solve one of the equations for either variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x - 3y =  - 3\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x - 3y + 3y =  - 3 + 3y\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x =  - 3 + 3y\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Substitute the expression from Step 1 into the other equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + y = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 3 + 3y + y = 5\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Solve the resulting equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 3 + 4y = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 3 + 4y + 3 = 5 + 3\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4y = 8\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = 2\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 4: Substitute the solution in Step 3 into either of the original equations to find the other variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + y = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + 2 = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x = 3\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 5: Write the solution as an ordered pair.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {3,2} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 6: Checking is left to you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "(3, 2)"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
